<body style="font-family:monospace; font-size: 14pt; color:#000000; background-color:#FFFFF0">

This is an animation realized by swapping the images in script ./nswap <br>
<br>

Image c2.png is shown, but each second a new image is named c2.png<br>
This file has in &lt;head&gt>  <br>
&lt;meta http-equiv="refresh" content="1"&gt  <br>
The "1" can be changed to any number of seconds <br> 
================================<br>
<img src="c2.png">
<br><br>
<span style="font-family:monospace;font-size: 14pt;  color:#000000">
<b>
system calls in the root_to_webN.C 
</b></span><br>
<!-- ------------------   systemcalls.txt    TEXT    BEGIN    ------------------- -->
&nbsp; <textarea readonly style=
"font-family:monospace; font-size: 14pt; color:#000000; background-color:#E0E0FF"
cols="100" rows="16">
   system("cat mathjax.fil >>  index.html");
   system("txtbox_blue index.html");
   system("echo \"<br><br><b>Source of this file (before adding)</b>\" >> index.html");
   system("cat index.html.html >> index.html");
   system("echo \"<br><br><b>The root macro root_to_webN.C </b>\" >> index.html");
   system("txtbox_white root_to_webN.C");
   system("cat root_to_webN.C.html >> index.html");
   system("txtbox_white about_html_2.txt");
   system("firefox  index.html  &");
   system("cp nswap swap");
   system("cp animate.fil animate.html");
   system("python3 -m http.server 8000 &");
   system("./swap &");
   system("firefox  http://127.0.0.1:8000/  &");

</textarea><br>
<!-- ---------------------   systemcalls.txt    END  TEXT ----------------- -->
   
